        _sd("Consciousness as Integrated Information: Mathematical Foundations", "Formalize Tononi's Integrated Information Theory (IIT) as a rigorous mathematical framework. Prove that the maximum integrated information Phi of a system is the minimum information partition. Show that Phi is NP-hard to compute and construct polynomial-time approximations.", ["Computation", "Logic", "Speculative"], 0.80),
